{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hoiime-grease-gun-sold-via-amazon-2606-0104","content_id":"6883dc61-a8ae-4b83-a189-ae8c96feb3ff","description":"Product Safety Report for HOIIME Grease Gun presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"aab566dc-2523-450d-96a7-01aee3d67419","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T14:28:06+01:00","id":"aab566dc-2523-450d-96a7-01aee3d67419","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:28:06+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f17e603b4fe14b1e7deb0/2606-0104_-product-safety-report-hiomme-grease-gun.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: HOIIME Grease Gun sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it is not supplied with a compatible charger.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery – Grease Guns (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>HOIIME</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>808yy (box only)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0F5Q6P7P7</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon Carton Identifiers</td>\n      <td>FBA15LHHGZGBU000006</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SKU</td>\n      <td>cool-PKC0808-UK-zk X002ACHWL9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Cordless grease gun with accessories.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_aab566dc-2523-450d-96a7-01aee3d67419\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7f17e603b4fe14b1e7deb0/2606-0104_-product-safety-report-hiomme-grease-gun.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product. There is no valid technical documentation for the product and no evidence of production control. There is a lack of labelling, marking and instructions. In the absence of evidence to demonstrate the conformity of the product, it may be possible for the product to overheat and catch fire. The product is also not supplied with a compatible battery or charger.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected by the border.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0104</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T13:28:31Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_aler